    "en": {
      "text": "Weapon Hits grant Grenade, Melee, and Class Ability Energy. Does not require Direct Hits.\n\nAbility Energy gains on Hits by weapon:\n• Trustee: 0.35%\n• Posterity: 0.45%\n• Commemoration: 0.4%\n• Heritage: 0.85%\n• Succession: 1.5%\n• Bequest: 2% (Grenade and Class Ability only)\n\n#ChunkEnergyScalars",
